  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-preview.4: First public preview. AWS Secrets Manager-backed IPostQuantumKeyStore for PostQuantum.DataProtection. Parallel structure to PostQuantum.DataProtection.AzureKeyVault — same secret-prefix model, same crash-safe write order (keypair secret before active-pointer secret), same narrow ISecretsManagerClient seam for unit tests.",
